.TH "PERFORMANCERESOURCETIMING.TOJSON" "3JS" "October 30, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
PerformanceResourceTiming.toJSON \- PerformanceResourceTiming: toJSON()
method
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is available in Web Workers.
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]toJSON()\f[B]\f[R] method of the
\f[CR]PerformanceResourceTiming\f[R] interface returns a
JSON\-serializable plain object representing the
\f[CR]PerformanceResourceTiming\f[R] object.
.PP
The method is automatically called by \f[CR]JSON.stringify()\f[R] when a
\f[CR]PerformanceResourceTiming\f[R] object is encountered during JSON
serialization.
.SH SYNTAX
.IP
.EX
toJSON()
.EE
.SS Parameters
None.
.SS Return value
A JSON\-serializable plain object containing the following properties:
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]name\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]entryType\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]startTime\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]duration\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]navigationId\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]initiatorType\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]deliveryType\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]nextHopProtocol\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]renderBlockingStatus\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]contentType\f[R]
